  ("US exits Vietnam; oil shock","Reagan presidency","Inflation, gas lines and a sense of national decline, deepened by the Iran hostage crisis, helped Reagan defeat Carter in 1980."),
  ("Iran hostage crisis","Reagan presidency","The 444-day crisis damaged Carter's presidency; the hostages were released minutes after Reagan took office."),
  ("Dot-com boom","Financial crisis; Obama elected","After the dot-com bust, low interest rates and loose lending fed a housing bubble that burst in 2007-08."),
