 links=[("Dollar leaves gold standard","US exits Vietnam; oil shock","The dollar's fall cut oil exporters' real income; OPEC used the 1973 war to quadruple prices."),
  ("US exits Vietnam; oil shock","Falklands War; debt crisis","Oil exporters' 'petrodollars' were lent to Latin America. When US interest rates soared to fight inflation, Mexico defaulted in 1982."),
  ("Deng's market reforms","China joins WTO; US invades Afghanistan","Two decades of export-led growth culminated in China's entry into the World Trade Organization."),
  ("Hong Kong returned; Asian Financial Crisis","Argentina defaults","After the Asian and Russian crises of 1997-98, investors fled emerging markets; Argentina's peg of its peso to the dollar became unsustainable."),
  ("Financial crisis; Obama elected","Eurozone debt crisis","The global crash exposed hidden deficits in Greece and banking bubbles in Ireland and Spain.")],
